  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfRecognitionOfTaxExpensesOfReconciliationOfAverageEffectiveTaxRateAndApplicableTaxRateLineItemsOfReconciliationOfAverageEffectiveTaxRateAndApplicableTaxRateTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" xml:lang="ko">법인세비용은 전체 회계연도에 대해 글로벌최저한세를 고려하여 추정한 최선의 가중평균연간법인세율로 인식하였습니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfRecognitionOfTaxExpensesOfReconciliationOfAverageEffectiveTaxRateAndApplicableTaxRateLineItemsOfReconciliationOfAverageEffectiveTaxRateAndApplicableTaxRateTableOfItems>
