  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfSharesOutstandingOfDisclosureOfShareCapitalLineItemsOfDisclosureOfShareCapitalTableTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfShareCapitalAxis_ifrs-full_PreferenceSharesMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간종료일 현재 회사가 발행한 우선주의 수(소각 주식수 제외)는 815,974,664주이며, 유통주식수는 자기주식 취득으로 인하여 발행주식의 총수와 차이가 있습니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfSharesOutstandingOfDisclosureOfShareCapitalLineItemsOfDisclosureOfShareCapitalTableTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:BondsIssuedIssueDateOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBondsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00126380_UsDollarDenominatedStraightBondsMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBondsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">1997-10-02</entity00126380:BondsIssuedIssueDateOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBondsTableOfItems>
